# yosys 0.55 (VTR build): read_rtlil srst_always.il; opt_dff; write_rtlil
# input: Yosys 0.55's own write_rtlil of the `read_verilog -icells` heredoc of tests/opt/opt_dff_srst.ys (always-active SRST) in the Yosys source (srst_always.il), edited by sed in two places: `parameter \X_POLARITY 1'b` written `b` and `parameter signed \WIDTH` written `parameter \WIDTH` (proc_build.c reads plain integer polarity and width parameters; the 2D-1 read_rtlil gap), in every cell
# flags:
cell $dff CLK_POLARITY=1 WIDTH=2
cell $dff CLK_POLARITY=1 WIDTH=2
cell $dff CLK_POLARITY=1 WIDTH=2
cell $dff CLK_POLARITY=1 WIDTH=2
cell $dffe CLK_POLARITY=1 EN_POLARITY=1 WIDTH=2
cell $dffe CLK_POLARITY=1 EN_POLARITY=1 WIDTH=2
init Q 010101010101
